The Serious Vibe Coding (svc) framework — including all skills, methodology,
documentation, scripts, tooling, naming conventions, and unique structural
patterns contained in this repository — is the exclusive intellectual property
of SSVE Maintainer (s7an-it).

In the event that SSVE Maintainer is permanently incapacitated or deceased,
all IP ownership and governance rights transfer to his immediate family as
designated by him or by legal succession. No community member, contributor,
or elected maintainer acquires ownership rights under any circumstances.

