You are permitted, free of charge, to:

  1. Use this framework as a tool to produce creative work, software,
     applications, or services — including running them in production and
     generating revenue from those creations. For example: building a mobile
     app, a SaaS product, a client project, or any other work that uses this
     framework as a development methodology or toolchain is permitted, even
     if that work is commercial. What you build WITH this framework is yours.

  2. Study the source code for educational purposes.

  3. Submit contributions (pull requests, issues, discussions) to this
     repository for the purpose of improving it, subject to the governance
     terms below.

