REQUESTING PERMISSION
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Permission for prohibited uses may be requested by contacting:
angelovsan@gmail.com

If permission is granted, the following conditions apply by default unless
separately negotiated in writing:

  a. ATTRIBUTION — Any product, service, content, or publication that uses
     or is powered by this framework must clearly state:
     "Built with Serious Vibe Coding by SSVE Maintainer (s7an-it)"
     in a location reasonably visible to end users or readers.

  b. SOCIAL PROMOTION — Any influencer, content creator, or social media
     account that promotes, reviews, or demonstrates work produced using
     this framework must reference the original source and author in the
     same post or video.

  c. PRIVATE / UNLISTED USE — If public attribution is not desired (e.g.,
     for confidential commercial use), additional terms must be negotiated
     and agreed in writing before use begins.

